/F1 20 Tf 72 742 Td (Drew's Mexican Street Corn) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 72 716 Td () Tj
/F1 11 Tf 72 706 Td (A smoky, creamy, slightly charred Mexican street corn-style side inspired by Drew's) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 72 691 Td (Mother's Day taco bar corn.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 72 676 Td () Tj
/F1 15 Tf 72 666 Td (Submitted By) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td () Tj
